  "id": "back-to-era-chrysea-handbook",
  "name": "\"Back to Era Chrysea\" Handbook",
  "sourceUrl": "https://honkai-star-rail.fandom.com/wiki/%22Back_to_Era_Chrysea%22_Handbook",
  "scrapedAt": "2026-07-28T09:31:09.357Z",
  "volumes": [
    {
      "id": "1",
      "volumeKey": "text",
      "label": "Text",
      "document": {
        "version": 1,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "To this day, we still weep for that resplendent Era Chrysea—"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The homeland we long for in our restless dreams."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Now, Strife's pointed arms pierce its smooth joints,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "And Trickery's profanities tarnish its solemn visage."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Its noble form, entombed beneath the River of Souls,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Is barred from the world by the Titans of Calamity."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-cb2e9b70a3971259"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "O great sky father, slumbering Throne of Worlds who upholds the Dawn,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Have you sown the seeds of a merciful prophecy,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "To guide that gilded age back to our side?"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "We can only offer it the purge of Calamity and show of piety."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The warriors shall split Strife's pointed arms and burn away Trickery's profanities;"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The warriors shall, too, vanquish the Tyrant in the River of Souls,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "And cleanse the cold bones of death, and from therein lift a past reborn —"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-e677c9f0d5cc463d"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "That future past is you, Era Chrysea,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The homeland in our restless dreams."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "You adorned the boundless sky, earth, and sea with untainted gleam."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "You guided humanity's path with Gate and Scale,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "And gently stashed thousands of tales behind the Veil."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "With your kiss, lovers and true bonds from this earth you create,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Under your witness, the all-knowing father blessed all with jovial fate."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-0de3f44dd3e17903"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Sky father above, we never sought that illusive afterlife —"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "We weep only for that resplendent Era Chrysea,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "For it is our homeland to which we must return."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-faec8d1d7dc980a2"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
